  "description": "because the Nevada is a sure\nthing. It's a totally trail-worthy, 8-speed-equipped mountain bike you\ncan own for a whole lot less than an overnight trip to Las Vegas. But\ntake it to Vegas anyway. I hear there's some mighty fine riding to be\nhad in the surrounding desert.\n\nThe Nevada keeps its weigh down and comfort and performance up with Custom\n7005 aluminum alloy frame tubing and SunTour's 80mm XXC-E suspension fork.\nThe Shimano EZ Fire shifters walk you easily through all eight rear gears\nand three chainrings so you'll never \"crap out\" on long climbs\nor have to \"fold\" on a fast descents. Thirty-six 14-gauge spokes\ngive you \"full-deck\" wheel durability while the machined rim\nbraking surfaces and ProMax linear pull brakes won't ever leave you feeling\nlike a \"suicide king\" when it's time to get your speed under\ncontrol.\n\nAnd, unlike a one-armed bandit (slot machine, that is), one size doesn't\nfit all. The Nevada is available in seven (count 'em!) sizes, including\n13- and 24 inches for all you XXS and XXL dirt lovers out there.",
